# Shared components (normative)

**Before adding or refactoring shared UI under `apps/webapp`, read:**

[`docs/specs/shared-components-spec.md`](../../docs/specs/shared-components-spec.md)

Pair with [app-shell-spec](../../docs/specs/app-shell-spec.md) (patterns) and [design-language-spec](../../docs/specs/design-language-spec.md) (visuals).

## Must use (when built)

| Area | Components |
|------|------------|
| List route | `PageQuery` · `DataState` · `ListPageHeader` · `FilterSelect` |
| Search / filters | `ListSearchField` · `FilterPanel` *(Phase 0 — until then, match their markup)* |
| Modals | `FormModal` · `ConfirmModal` · `PickerModal` |
| Gating | `PermissionGate` |
| Drawer | `DetailDrawer` · `DrawerEntityHeader` *(Phase 0)* · `DrawerField` · `DrawerEmptyState` · `DrawerActionBar` |
| People | `StaffPicker` · `StudentPicker` · `GuardianPicker` |
| Permissions | `ScopeBuilder` · `StaffPermissionFormModal` only |

## Do not

- Copy inline search pill markup — use `ListSearchField` when landed
- Chip-bar main filters — `FilterSelect` + `FilterPanel`
- Duplicate drawer identity blocks — `DrawerEntityHeader`
- Ad-hoc person `<select>` lists — picker family
- New shared component without updating the registry in the same PR

## New shared component rule

Add to registry only when **≥3 features** need the same pattern.
